classDiagram
    %% PawPal+ class diagram — draft
    %% Four core classes: Owner, Pet, Task, Scheduler

    class Owner {
        +str name
        +int available_minutes
        +str preferred_start_time
        +list~Pet~ pets
        +add_pet(pet) None
        +get_pets() list
    }

    class Pet {
        +str name
        +str species
        +str breed
        +int age_years
        +list~Task~ tasks
        +add_task(task) None
        +get_tasks() list
    }

    class Task {
        +str title
        +int duration_minutes
        +str priority
        +bool recurring
        +str notes
        +is_high_priority() bool
    }

    class Scheduler {
        +Owner owner
        +Pet pet
        +int available_minutes
        +generate_plan() list
        +sort_tasks(tasks) list
        +filter_tasks(tasks, available_minutes) list
        +explain_plan(scheduled, skipped) str
    }

    Owner "1" --> "1..*" Pet : owns
    Pet "1" --> "0..*" Task : has
    Scheduler --> Owner : uses
    Scheduler --> Pet : uses
    Scheduler --> Task : schedules
